  "configuration_id": "config_010",
  "reason": "Evidence: The only completed experiment (config_001, rna_only/singleprofile/pca_n2000) achieved a low validation accuracy of ~48.5%, leaving substantial uncertainty about whether the RNA modality alone is sufficient or whether the image modality carries complementary signal. Question: This experiment tests whether an image-only model (resnet50, singleprofile) can achieve comparable or better accuracy, directly isolating the modality question while holding profile setting (singleprofile) and model complexity constant relative to config_001. Why: With 8 experiments remaining, resolving whether image features are informative is the highest-impact early decision—if image-only performs well, the multimodal space (configs 016–051) becomes a promising exploitation target; if it performs poorly, we can focus remaining budget on RNA encoder and profile improvements. This is a clean, single-variable comparison that maximally reduces uncertainty about the most fundamental design axis."
}

